  "scope": [
    "Adjugate locality uses the actual coordinate value germ, derivative germ and height germ, so it also preserves the physical coefficient evaluation point.",
    "The whole negative selector uses its proved actual stored root germ. Its every finite principal derivative is therefore the derivative of the same physical reference coefficient by the separately proved closed-negative theorem.",
